13. FORKS

Forks and modified versions are permitted where AGPL-3.0 permits them.

However:

A fork is not automatically an official VULTURE project.

A fork must not intentionally misrepresent:

- its origin;
- its authorship;
- its maintenance;
- its relationship to black-210;
- its relationship to the original VULTURE project;
- or its official status.

A fork may accurately identify itself as:

«"A fork of VULTURE"»

when that statement is truthful.

It may not falsely identify itself as:

«"The official VULTURE project"»

without authorization.

